  "text": [
    "--------------------------",
    "The PDU SESSION AUTHENTICATION RESULT message is sent by the SMF to the UE for indication of successful result of authentication of the UE participating in the PDU session. See table8.3.6.1.1",
    "Message type: PDU SESSION AUTHENTICATION RESULT",
    "Direction: network to UE",
    "NOTE: It is possible for UEs compliant with version 15.2.1 or earlier versions of this specification to send the Mapped EPS bearer contexts IE with IEI of value \"7F\" for this message",
    "",
    ""
